{
  "name": "Generación de leads: repuestos (Chaco)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Inicio manual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "apiKey",
              "value": "{{ $env.GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "keyword",
              "value": "repuestos"
            },
            {
              "name": "location",
              "value": "-27.4220824,-60.9482994"
            },
            {
              "name": "radius",
              "value": "110000"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-config",
      "name": "Configurar búsqueda",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📌 Propósito del flujo\n- Busca \"repuestos\" en el área de Resistencia (Chaco, Argentina) usando Google Maps.\n- Devuelve nombre, dirección, coordenadas, teléfono y web (si existen) de cada comercio.\n- Requiere una API Key de Google Maps con permisos del Places API. Cárgala en la variable \`GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY\`.\n\n### Cómo usarlo\n1. Completa o sobreescribe los valores en **Configurar búsqueda**.\n2. Ejecuta el flujo con **Test workflow**.\n3. Descarga los datos desde el último nodo (Formatear Lead) o encadénalo a Sheets/CRM según tu stack.\n\n### Parámetros principales\n- **keyword**: término de búsqueda (\"repuestos\" por defecto).\n- **location**: latitud,longitud de referencia (-27.4220824,-60.9482994).\n- **radius**: radio en metros (110000 ≈ 110 km).",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/place/textsearch/json?query={{$json.keyword}}&location={{$json.location}}&radius={{$json.radius}}&language=es&key={{$json.apiKey}}",
        "responseFormat": "json",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "fullResponse": false,
          "headers": {
            "Accept-Language": "es-419"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "places-search",
      "name": "Buscar en Google Places",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const apiKey = $node['Configurar búsqueda'].json.apiKey;\nconst results = $input.first().json.results || [];\nreturn results.map((r) => ({\n  json: {\n    apiKey,\n    place_id: r.place_id,\n    nombre: r.name,\n    direccion: r.formatted_address,\n    lat: r.geometry?.location?.lat,\n    lng: r.geometry?.location?.lng\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "flatten-results",
      "name": "Expandir resultados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/place/details/json?place_id={{$json.place_id}}&fields=name,formatted_address,international_phone_number,website,geometry&language=es&key={{$json.apiKey}}",
        "responseFormat": "json",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "fullResponse": false,
          "headers": {
            "Accept-Language": "es-419"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "place-details",
      "name": "Detalles por lugar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const result = $input.first().json.result || {};\nconst nombre = result.name || 'Sin nombre';\nconst direccion = result.formatted_address || 'Sin dirección';\nconst lat = result.geometry?.location?.lat;\nconst lng = result.geometry?.location?.lng;\nconst telefono = result.international_phone_number || 'No disponible';\nconst pagina_web = result.website || 'No disponible';\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    nombre,\n    direccion,\n    ubicacion: lat && lng ? `${lat},${lng}` : 'No disponible',\n    telefono,\n    pagina_web,\n    fuente: 'Google Maps (Places API)'
  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "format-lead",
      "name": "Formatear lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1640,
        320
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Configurar búsqueda": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Buscar en Google Places",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Buscar en Google Places": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Expandir resultados",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Expandir resultados": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Detalles por lugar",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Detalles por lugar": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Formatear lead",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Inicio manual": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configurar búsqueda",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
